            "value" : ", "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「戻す」で戻れます。ヒントの回数は減っていません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use Undo to go back. This didn't use up a hint."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「戻す」は1局につき%1$lld回まで無料です。残り回数はボタンに出ています。使い切ったあとは、広告を見ると%2$lld回ぶん補充できます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You get %1$lld free undos per game. The button shows how many are left. Once they're used up, watch an ad to get %2$lld more"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「戻す」を補充できませんでした" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn't Add Undos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「新規ゲーム」を押すと、山札を1枚ずつめくるか3枚ずつめくるかを選べます。3枚めくりでは使えるのがいちばん上の1枚だけになるぶん歯ごたえがあり、自己ベストは1枚めくりとは別に記録されます（Game Center の順位表に載るのは1枚めくりだけです）。選んだめくり方はその配札のあいだ変わりません" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap New Game to choose whether to draw 1 or 3 cards at a time from the stock. In Draw 3 only the top card can be played, which makes it tougher, and personal bests are kept separately from Draw 1 (only Draw 1 goes on the leaderboard). The draw mode stays the same for the whole deal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このままではクリアできません" : {
