    },
    "伏せ札%lld枚" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld face-down card"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld face-down cards"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使い切ったあと、手詰まりになったときや、指せる手はあってもクリアできなくなったときに、広告を見て1枚受け取れます。「戻す」でジョーカーを置いた手を巻き戻せば、手持ちに戻ります。ジョーカーを使ってクリアした記録は、自己ベストには残りますが Game Center の順位表には送りません" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once it's used, you can watch an ad to get another when you're stuck, or when moves remain but the game can no longer be cleared. Undoing the move where you placed a Joker puts it back in your hand. Clears that used a Joker count toward your personal best but aren't sent to the leaderboard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出題する配札は、すべて事前にコンピュータで解いてクリアできることを確かめてあります。行き止まりは配りのせいではなく、指し方で変わります" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every deal has been solved by computer in advance to make sure it can be cleared. If you get stuck, it's down to how you played, not the deal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動かしたい札をタップして選び、置きたい列か組札をタップします。もう一度同じ札をタップすると選択を外せます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a card to select it, then tap the column or foundation to move it to. Tap the same card again to deselect it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動かせません" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "can't be moved"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "場札の並べ方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Building the tableau"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "場札（下の7列）には、ひとつ上の札より1つ小さくて色ちがいの札だけを置けます（黒の8 の上には 赤の7）。そろっている並びは何枚でもまとめて動かせます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the tableau (the 7 columns at the bottom), a card can only go on one that's one higher and the opposite color (a red 7 on a black 8). A correctly ordered run can be moved together, however long it is"
          }
        }
      }
    },
