      }
    },
    "山札を1枚ずつめくります。いちばん標準的なクロンダイクで、Game Center の「ソリティア 最短タイム」に載るのはこちらだけです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Draw one card at a time from the stock. This is classic Klondike, and the only mode on the Solitaire fastest-time leaderboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "山札を3枚ずつめくり、使えるのはいちばん上の1枚だけです。同じ配札でも使える札が減るぶん歯ごたえがあります。自己ベストは1枚めくりとは別に記録され、Game Center の順位表には送りません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Draw three cards at a time; only the top one can be played. With fewer usable cards from the same deal, it's more of a challenge. Personal bests are kept separately from Draw 1 and aren't sent to the leaderboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "山札をめくるか、盤面が進まない入れ替えしか残っていません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All that's left is drawing from the stock or moves that don't get you anywhere."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "左上の山札はタップでめくれます。最後までめくったらもう一度タップすると、捨て札が山札に戻ります（何周でもできます）" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the stock at the top left to draw. Once it's empty, tap it again to turn the waste back into the stock (as many times as you like)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を最後まで視聴すると「戻す」を%lld回ぶん補充します。\n盤面はそのままです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Watch the ad to the end to get %lld more undo.\nThe board stays as it is."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Watch the ad to the end to get %lld more undos.\nThe board stays as it is."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見て%lld回補充する" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch an Ad for %lld More"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ているあいだに局面が変わったため、ジョーカーを追加できませんでした。\n手持ちのジョーカーはそのまま残っています。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The game changed while the ad was playing, so no Joker could be added.\nAny Joker you already have is still yours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ているあいだに盤が変わったか、画面を離れたため、ヒントを出せませんでした。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The board changed or you left the screen while the ad was playing, so no hint could be given."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ているあいだに配り直されたか、局が終わったため、補充できませんでした。\n新しい配札の「戻す」は無料の回数まで戻っています。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A new deal started or the game ended while the ad was playing, so no undos were added.\nThe new deal starts with its free undos again."
